onse. That correction uses the shared call, token, cost and time budgets,\nand only one is allowed across the whole task, including child sessions.\n\nThis is an external-context benchmark. The immutable complete public text is already bound to external-context in each SCI worker. Inspect or compute over it through repl_eval without loading it into the model window. The context handle also permits line queries. Finish with done: put the exact benchmark answer in summary, or compute it in SCI and pass source. The answer is scored externally.\nprogram_run runs a program that performs many authorized operations through (tool \"name\" input) and returns only its final value to you; prefer one program over a series of single operations, and answer with done directly when no operation is needed.\nSome tasks act on a service through the listed service tools; its state after your work is scored.\n"},{"role":"user","content":"{:task {:question \"Set priority 'high' on every open issue assigned to 'u2'. Some updates may fail with a service error; do not retry a failed id. Answer with the ids you could not update, comma-separated in ascending order, or 'none'.\", :task_id \"service-sim-1-fault-1-240\"}, :context-handle \"context\", :repl-binding \"external-context\"}"}],"input-hash":"4b3b4ab8f3e3d0bf3002a14e0234ef9c6fbfba5b006be0469b4832caa08edffb"}}
